# Auto-generated blog snapshots. Regenerated on every `yarn dev`/`yarn build`
# via the predev/prebuild/build scripts (scripts/generate-blog-static-data.mjs)
# from the live API, so the committed copies are overwritten immediately and
# never actually relied upon. Keeping them tracked only caused constant,
# meaningless diffs. See lib/blogApi.ts — these paths are explicitly marked
# as deprecated build artifacts; the live site fetches blog data straight
# from the API, not from these files.
/data/blog-list-cache.json
/data/blog-build-ids.json
/public/blog-list.json
/public/blog-data/
